# THE QA HARNESSES BELONG IN .tools/, NOT AT THE ROOT.
# aboutqa.mjs, refactorqa.mjs and storyqa.mjs were committed to the repo root
# by accident — they are Playwright scripts that drive a local server and
# assert against it, they import a browser driver the site does not use, and
# Vercel served them at their own URLs. .tools/ above already excludes the rest
# of them; this catches any that land at the top level again.
# (Deployment exclusions are separate and live in .vercelignore.)
/*.mjs

# THE SCREENSHOTS CLAUDE TAKES WHILE WORKING ARE NOT PART OF THE SITE.
# `Claude outputs/` had 35 PNGs and 8.9MB of it committed — before/after frames
# from theme, grid and panel work. They were useful in the conversation that
# produced them and they are dead weight in the history of a static site, which
# Vercel would also have served at their own public URLs. Kept on disk, out of
# git. (Deployment exclusions are separate and live in .vercelignore.)
Claude outputs/
